			"notes": "First official release of the **Fabric ChemLib** library for **Minecraft 1.19** on **Fabric Loader 0.14.6**\n\n**ChemLib adds several chemistry related items including:**\n- All 118 chemical elements found on the periodic table.\n- Ingots, nuggets, dusts, and plates for all elements that make sense (i.e. all except for gases, mercury, etc).\n- Dozens of chemical compounds in solid, liquid, gas, and dust forms.\n- Gases and liquids in bucket or block form (upside-down bucket is for gases, regular bucket is for liquids).\n- Redstone powered gas lamps and metal blocks for all elements that make sense.\n- An interactive periodic table of elements that players can craft."
		}
